Z||000016||Eric||02-14-2001||11:37 PM||||I hope, for your sake, it wasn't a big or expensive present.  I always thought Valentines Day was for people in serious relationships.  She may just think you're being creepy and weird especially if she only thinks of you as a "friend".  If you remain ambiguous about your intentions, you may be able to get away with telling her it's a birthday gift.  Try not to ruin a potentially good thing.||||reg||1
