Z||000018||Eric||02-15-2001||12:20 AM||||Sorry dude, but you're screwed.  If she expected it, and you're really bad at reading signals, then you may be okay.  But there's just no way you'd be able to pass that off as a b-day gift.  At this point you should think about damage control.  Call her the day after tommorow and mention your gift to her.  Don't make a big deal out of it, just be funny.  Make it sound as if you did it half joking, if that makes any sense.  Don't make it sound like a goof, but just be charming like friends would do.  And for God's sake, don't do anything like this again without consulting me first!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
